{"path":"utility/functional/function/assign","title":"std::function<R(Args...)>::assign","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::function&lt;R(Args...)&gt;::</span>assign","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/functional/function/assign","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Initializes the target with f. The alloc is used to allocate memory for any internal data structures that the function might use.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> F, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Alloc <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> assign<span class=\"br0\">(</span> F<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> f, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Alloc<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> alloc <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx17\">(removed in C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Initializes the <i>target</i> with <code>f</code>. The <code>alloc</code> is used to allocate memory for any internal data structures that the <code>function</code> might use.\n</p><p>Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">function<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/allocator_arg\"><span class=\"kw707\">std::<span class=\"me2\">allocator_arg</span></span></a>, alloc, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>F<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  f\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  callable function to initialize the <i>target</i> with\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  alloc\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  allocator to use to allocate memory for the internal data structures\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/function/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  assigns a new target <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/functional","title":"Function objects"},{"path":"utility/functional/function","title":"std::function"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::function<R(Args...)>::assign","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11, until C++17. Initializes the target with f."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"f, alloc"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator=","note":"assigns a new target"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17"],"wordCount":86,"codeBlockCount":0}
